{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01089",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.24,
      "end_seconds": 2.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Evening. Let's get started."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 4.09,
      "end_seconds": 9.73,
      "duration_seconds": 5.64,
      "text": "Hi doctor, I got here as fast as I could."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 11.19,
      "end_seconds": 17.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.82,
      "text": "Doctor, I'll sit in if that's okay, I know what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.5,
      "end_seconds": 23.8,
      "duration_seconds": 5.3,
      "text": "Please do. Extra information is always welcome. Tell me what's brought you in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 25.13,
      "end_seconds": 29.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "She's been getting lost on familiar roads, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.15,
      "end_seconds": 41.41,
      "duration_seconds": 10.26,
      "text": "And I've been misplacing things as well. And I've been forgetting things lately as well, for four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 42.86,
      "end_seconds": 48.36,
      "duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "text": "Any low mood, headache, weakness on one side or falls at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.01,
      "end_seconds": 53.81,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.71,
      "end_seconds": 56.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Anything unusual with passing urine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 57.48,
      "end_seconds": 60.36,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "No, uh, that's all fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.57,
      "end_seconds": 65.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.01,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 67.28,
      "end_seconds": 69.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "I move fine otherwise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.82,
      "end_seconds": 78.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.92,
      "end_seconds": 82.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "No, I'm not allergic to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.31,
      "end_seconds": 87.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "What about your parents, brothers or sisters, any conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.03,
      "end_seconds": 91.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.32,
      "text": "My grandfather had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.42,
      "end_seconds": 105.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.33,
      "end_seconds": 111.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "Yes, high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.53,
      "end_seconds": 116.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Yes, carry on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.87,
      "end_seconds": 125.41,
      "duration_seconds": 7.54,
      "text": "I've got high blood pressure. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.32,
      "end_seconds": 127.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "So, anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.89,
      "end_seconds": 134.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "I have diabetes, for nearly five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.43,
      "end_seconds": 146.41,
      "duration_seconds": 9.98,
      "text": "Alright, high blood pressure and diabetes, that matches what I have here. Okay, do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 146.97,
      "end_seconds": 150.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Rosuvastatin, 10 milligrams, at night for my cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 152.09,
      "end_seconds": 160.57,
      "duration_seconds": 8.48,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the rosuvastatin was 5 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 161.67,
      "end_seconds": 164.95,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Alright. Did you bring the up-to-date prescription?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.26,
      "end_seconds": 174.13,
      "duration_seconds": 7.87,
      "text": "I don't think I have it with me. Losartan, 50 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 175.05,
      "end_seconds": 183.61,
      "duration_seconds": 8.56,
      "text": "She is supposed to take it once a day, but I can't say she always does."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 184.25,
      "end_seconds": 187.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "I take sitagliptin, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.22,
      "end_seconds": 190.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "And what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.43,
      "end_seconds": 193.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.51,
      "text": "It's 100 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.41,
      "end_seconds": 198.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Since when have you been taking it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 204.02,
      "end_seconds": 206.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "For about a year."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 207.01,
      "end_seconds": 209.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.65,
      "end_seconds": 212.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "I swim twice a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.92,
      "end_seconds": 214.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Who lives with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.81,
      "end_seconds": 219.2,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "My partner and our baby."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.72,
      "end_seconds": 223.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.66,
      "end_seconds": 239.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Nearly done with the readings..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.86,
      "end_seconds": 264.1,
      "duration_seconds": 9.24,
      "text": "Okay: pulse 72, pressure 127 over 76, SpO2 98 percent on room air, respiratory rate 18, temp 36.7 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.06,
      "end_seconds": 272.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.46,
      "end_seconds": 275.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "Hold that for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.03,
      "end_seconds": 296.6,
      "duration_seconds": 5.57,
      "text": "Your gait is steady and the tone in your limbs is normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 301.32,
      "end_seconds": 304.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 317.92,
      "end_seconds": 337.9,
      "duration_seconds": 19.98,
      "text": "Putting it all together, it fits best with memory difficulties that need to be worked up. We shouldn't forget early dementia. Let me repeat that back to make sure. You've been getting lost on familiar roads, and no falls or weakness on one side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 343.69,
      "end_seconds": 345.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "That's what happened, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 348.36,
      "end_seconds": 359.37,
      "duration_seconds": 11.01,
      "text": "We should do a vitamin B12 level for memory loss. I want a CT scan of the head done, that's for memory loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 361.31,
      "end_seconds": 364.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Right, when would that take place?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 366.13,
      "end_seconds": 390.32,
      "duration_seconds": 24.19,
      "text": "Keep a daily routine and write things down, a notebook by the door works well. I'll also refer you to the memory clinic. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. So, that's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 391.96,
      "end_seconds": 396.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.5,
      "text": "Right, uh, I'll do that. Thank you, doctor."
    }
  ]
}